---
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Global Relocation Resources | EverywhereJob</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Discover the best communities, forums, and websites to connect with other remote workers and local hires globally." />
    
    <style>
      body { font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f5; color: #3f3f46; line-height: 1.6; padding: 0 0 4rem 0; margin: 0; }
      .site-header { background: #ffffff; border-bottom: 1px solid #e4e4e7; padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
      .header-container { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
      .logo-link { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s; }
      .logo-link:hover { opacity: 0.8; }
      .logo-icon { font-size: 1.3rem; }
      .logo-text { font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.2rem; color: #18181b; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
      .logo-highlight { color: #16a34a; }
      .nav-text-link:hover { color: #18181b !important; }
      .get-started-btn { background: #16a34a; color: white; padding: 0.5rem 1.25rem; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; transition: background 0.2s; }
      .get-started-btn:hover { background: #15803d; }
      
      .wrapper { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; }
      .card { background: #ffffff; border-radius: 20px; padding: 3rem; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px -15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); border: 1px solid #e4e4e7; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
      h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; color: #18181b; margin-top: 0; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.2; }
      p.subtitle { font-size: 1.1rem; color: #52525b; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
      h2 { color: #18181b; font-size: 1.5rem; margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #e4e4e7; padding-bottom: 0.5rem; }
      ul.resource-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
      ul.resource-list li { background: #fafafa; border: 1px solid #f4f4f5; padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 12px; }
      .resource-title { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #18181b; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; text-decoration: none; }
      .resource-title:hover { color: #16a34a; text-decoration: underline; }
      .resource-desc { font-size: 0.95rem; color: #52525b; margin: 0; }
      footer { text-align: center; margin-top: 4rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #a1a1aa; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="site-header">
      <div class="header-container" style="justify-content: space-between; width: 100%;">
        <a href="/" class="logo-link" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; text-decoration: none;">
          <span class="logo-icon">💼</span>
          <span class="logo-text">Everywhere<span class="logo-highlight">Job</span></span>
        </a>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: center;">
          <a href="/resources" class="nav-text-link" style="color: #71717a; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.95rem; transition: color 0.2s;">Resources</a>
          <a href="/guide" class="get-started-btn">Get Started</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="wrapper">
      <div class="card">
        <h1>Global Relocation Resources</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Moving overseas as an expat is a life-changing experience, but navigating it can be daunting. Here is a curated directory of communities to connect with fellow professionals, share tips, and build your network.</p>

        <h2>Reddit Communities</h2>
        <ul class="resource-list">
          <li>
            <a href="https://www.reddit.com/r/digitalnomad/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="resource-title">r/digitalnomad</a>
            <p class="resource-desc">A major community tailored for individuals that leverage technology in order to work remotely and live an independent and nomadic lifestyle.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://www.reddit.com/r/expats/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="resource-title">r/expats</a>
            <p class="resource-desc">An active subreddit covering the everyday life of global expats. As of 2026, it hosts around 233,000 members discussing questions, stories, and opinions.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://www.reddit.com/r/IWantOut/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="resource-title">r/IWantOut</a>
            <p class="resource-desc">A dedicated space for individuals actively looking to emigrate or plan a move abroad.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Forums & Networking Platforms</h2>
        <ul class="resource-list">
          <li>
            <a href="https://www.internations.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="resource-title">InterNations</a>
            <p class="resource-desc">A platform aimed at fostering a strong sense of community among expats worldwide. They host local events and in-person industry networking opportunities.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://www.expat.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="resource-title">Expat.com</a>
            <p class="resource-desc">A specialized website including forums, articles, destination guides, and spaces for career networking.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://nomadlist.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="resource-title">Nomad List</a>
            <p class="resource-desc">A popular resource site that tracks metrics for cities and features its own large Slack community (requires membership).</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://www.meetup.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="resource-title">Meetup</a>
            <p class="resource-desc">A fantastic website for finding social groups and events based on your interests in your new local area.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Social Media & Chat Groups</h2>
        <ul class="resource-list">
          <li>
            <span class="resource-title">Facebook Groups</span>
            <p class="resource-desc">Search for broad networks like "Digital Nomads Around The World" or demographic-specific groups such as "Girl Gone International" to connect offline.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="resource-title">Slack Communities</span>
            <p class="resource-desc">Communities like Nomads Talk allow you to chat with members, be notified of events, and join location-specific channels.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>

      </div>
      
      </div> </div> <footer class="contact-pane">
      <div class="contact-container">
        <h2>Get in Touch</h2>
        <p>Have questions about a specific market or want to report outdated data? Drop us a line.</p>
        
        <form action="https://formspree.io/f/xgobqeky" method="POST" class="contact-form">
          <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Your Email Address" required />
          <textarea name="message" rows="4" placeholder="How can we help?" required></textarea>
          <button type="submit">Send Message</button>
        </form>
        
        <p style="margin-top: 3rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #52525b;">
          EverywhereJob — Data sourced via Numbeo indexing databases, local statutory immigration logs, and ongoing international compensation reviews.
        </p>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>